    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yuda na Tamara",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ing'inga yeyo Yuda yaleka avamwavo nazia komenya nu umundu walangwa Hira, kutura mu lidaala lia Adulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wene yeyo, Yuda yavugana nu mukaana mu Kanaani wa baba weve yalangwa Shua. Yamuleta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma namwivulira mwana muyaayi wagulikwa Eri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yavereka ma niyivura mwana wundi muyaayi namugulika Onani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yivula kandi mwana muyaayi ma namugulika Shela. Yuda yaali naveeye ha Akizibu lwu muyaayi uyu yiivulwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda yanyolera Eri muyaayi weve wukutanga mukali walangwa Tamara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa Yahova yita Eri kigira miima jije jaali midamanu kandi si yayanzizwa najo mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku Yuda yavolera Onani amwavo Eri, “Zia ove harara numukunzakali wa amwavo woovo. Utwekizi lienya liilio kuye kuli amwavo musaza weve, kunangwa amwavo woovo ave nivisukululwi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa Onani yamanya ndi avana sivalava aveeve mba. Kunangwa lwa yaali harara numukunzakali wa amwavo weve, yakola uvusaza vwivwe vuzie hasi kunangwa mukunzakali uyu avuli kwivura mwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga yakola si gayaanziza Yahova mba, kunangwa Yahova yamwita kandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku Yuda yavolera navizara weve Tamara, “Uzie yengo ku baba woovo kuduuka lwu muyaayi wange shela ahindiraa.” Yavoola yaga kigira yaali nuvuti ndi Shela alakiitwi kuli avamwavo. Kunangwa Tamara yirana yengo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyima wi ing'inga indambi mukali wa Yuda mukaana wa Shua yakuza. Lwa Yuda yaali niyakasosa kutura muvovereri, yazia Timina kolola avandu vavega magondi uvwoya. Mulina weve Hira kutura Adulamu yazia naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umundu yavolera Tamara navizara baba woovo azizaa Timina kukala magondi geege uvwoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa yaagirung'anya zinguvu ziuvukunzakali zia yaali niyiviiki, ma nakunika mumoni mwimwe ni kitambaya, kandi niyikara hasi muvwingiliru vwa Enaimu, lidaala liveeye kunzira izizaa Timina. Yaali namanyi vulahi ndi muyaayi wa Yuda winyima Shela numuhindira, navuzwa si vamuha ave musaza weve mba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa Yuda yamulola yaganagana ni liraya kigira yaali nakuniki mumoni mwimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vugira kumanyiriza ndi oyo ni navizara weve, yisunda kuye ahimbi kunzira ma navoora “Hamba kalunu leka mbe harara na ivi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamuteeva, “Ivi ulamba kindiki?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yativura, “Inzi ndakuha kememe chi imburi kutura mu mitugu jange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yavoola, “Gaveeye malahi, niiva ivi ulamba kindu ngumiri kuli kulaga kuduuka lwa ondetera imburi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yateva, “Inzi nyara kukuha kindiki cha ngumira?” Yativura, “Imingiri numuhuri kandi nimbimbu eveeye mu mukono gugwo.” Yamanya nahaana vindu viene yivi. Maku yaali harara naye ma naavereka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tamara yirana yengo, natuliza kitambaya mumoni, ma niyivika zinguvu zizie ziuvukunzakali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda yatuma mulina weve Hira kumuhilira imburi ma avuguli kutura ku mukali ivindu via yaali namuheye, navuzwa Hira si yamunyola mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yateeva avandu vaali ha Enaimu, “Liraya lialange yaaha kunzira liveeye haliha?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vaativura, “Liraya likikiri kuvaku hano mba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hira yirana ma na avooreraa Yuda, “Inzi simunyoye mba, kandi avandu va Enaimu vavooye ndi liraya likikiri kuvaku heneyaho mba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda yavoola, “Leka ave ni vindu yivio. Kunyi si kwenya vandu vakosekelizi mba. Inzi ndaageriza kumutunga, navuzwa ivi siumunyooye mba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
